exports[`what a reader sees on the record page, state by state > privateItem 1`] = `
"Product check
# Private item
The owner keeps this item's details private. To check the product in your hand, tap its tag.
[closed drawer]
## How the check works
- Every tag proves itself
Each tap makes a one-time code that only the real tag can produce. A copy fails.
- Brands register each item
The check compares the tag with the brand's record of that exact item.
- Records can't be quietly changed
They are kept on a public ledger that anyone can inspect.
[end of drawer]
[closed drawer]
## Technical details
Record number: 58
Network: Base Sepolia (test network)
[end of drawer]
